WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.504 --> 00:00:03.004
(clock ticks)

00:00:06.130 --> 00:00:07.130
- [Narrator] In an alpine valley

00:00:07.130 --> 00:00:09.300
in western Switzerland lies a city

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:12.642
at the very heart of an
area known as Watch Valley.

00:00:12.642 --> 00:00:15.090
This is La Chaux-De-Fonds.

00:00:15.090 --> 00:00:16.930
This is one of the beating hearts

00:00:16.930 --> 00:00:18.963
of the Swiss watchmaking industry.

00:00:19.870 --> 00:00:23.183
Welcome to the City of Time.

00:00:31.698 --> 00:00:34.531
(classical music)

00:01:35.313 --> 00:01:38.730
(upbeat classical music)

00:02:28.864 --> 00:02:31.364
(piano music)

